      ],
      "image": "assets/images/47954/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Cook sausage and onion in a large skillet over medium heat, stirring until evenly browned. Drain excess grease.",
